`confidential-data-handling` \[LongDash] \:6a5f\:5bc6\:30c7\:30fc\:30bf\:306e\
\:30e9\:30c3\:30d4\:30f3\:30b0\:624b\:9806\n\n## \:30d5\:30a1\:30a4\:30eb\
\:8aad\:307f\:8fbc\:307f\:30eb\:30fc\:30eb\n\n- \
\:30d5\:30a1\:30a4\:30eb\:540d\:3060\:3051\:304c\:6307\:5b9a\:3055\:308c\:305f\
\:5834\:5408\:ff08\:30d5\:30eb\:30d1\:30b9\:3067\:306a\:3044\:5834\:5408\:ff09\
