instruction\"]\n- To CREATE a new package: \
ClaudeCreatePackage[\"PackageName\", \"specification\"]\n- To generate \
documentation: ClaudeCreateDocumentation[\"PackageName\"]\n- To update \
documentation: ClaudeUpdateDocumentation[\"PackageName\", \"update \
instruction\"]\nNEVER read package source files manually with \
Import/ReadString.\nNEVER attempt to rewrite package files with Export/Put.\n\
