\:60c5\:5831\:ff1a\n\n### \:4e3b\:8981\:306aClaude Code\:95a2\:9023\:30ea\
\:30dd\:30b8\:30c8\:30ea\n1. **anthropics/claude-code** - \nClaude Code is an \
agentic coding tool that lives in your terminal, understands your codebase, \
and helps you code faster by executing routine tasks, explaining complex \
code, and handling git workflows - all through natural language commands.\n\n\
\n2. **anthropics/claude-plugins-official** - \nOfficial, Anthropic-managed \
directory of high quality Claude Code Plugins.\n\n\n### \:4e00\:822c\:7684\
\:306aREADME.md\:306e\:8a18\:8f09\:30df\:30b9\:306e\:30d1\:30bf\:30fc\:30f3\n\
