\:7684\:306a\:554f\:984c\:ff1a\n\n1. **\:30a4\:30f3\:30b9\:30c8\:30fc\:30eb\
\:624b\:9806\:306e\:554f\:984c**\n   - \nInstallation via npm is deprecated. \
Use one of the recommended methods below.\n\n\n2. **\:30c9\:30ad\:30e5\:30e1\
\:30f3\:30c8\:306e\:4e0d\:6574\:5408**\n   - \nThe attention budget (why less \
is more) Anthropic's official include/exclude table\n\n\n3. **\:8a2d\:5b9a\
\:30d5\:30a1\:30a4\:30eb\:306e\:8a18\:8f09\:30a8\:30e9\:30fc**\n   - \nThis \
documentation uses \"skills\" as the primary term, but you may see both used \
interchangeably. They both refer to markdown files in .claude/commands/ that \
you invoke with /skill-name.\n\n\n## \:63d0\:6848\:3055\:308c\:308b\:30a2\
